    "title": "Poker Offline",
    "description": "<b>Poker Offline:  Play poker with players from all over the world when you are online or Offline! An authentic Poker app where lots of interesting variations like Texas Holdem Poker, Sit-N-Go, Poker-Match-3, Blackjack, spin-wheel are available. </b>\r\n\r\nGo on a world tour or compete in intense environments in our Sit N Go Tournaments, place bets, go All IN, Bluff, put your Texas Hold'em strategy to win big! Go up the poker-ranking ladder by winning tournaments & Sit-N-Go games.\r\n\r\nList of features:\r\n<b>\u25cf FREE CHIPS:</b> Free Chips every 15 minutes and Daily Chips Bonus to boost your chips.\r\n<b>\u25cf Tournaments:</b> Multi-level Sit&Go tournaments to win trophies and compete with the best poker players in the world.\r\n<b>\u25cf Offline Or Online</b> Play with computers/bots while offline without internet OR with friends/players from around the world when online.\r\n<b>\u25cf Game Modes:</b> NO LIMIT HOLD'EM, SIT&GO, Poker-Match-3, BLACKJACK, LUCKY WHEEL.\r\n<b>\u25cf NO LIMIT HOLD'EM:</b> No limit on chips you can win in this game mode.\r\n<b>\u25cf Poker statistics:</b> Track and improve your game with extensive poker statistics.\r\n<b>\u25cf BLACKJACK:</b> Play blackjack in the same app.\r\n<b>\u25cf Rankings & Leagues\ud83c\udfc5:</b> Dominate the world of poker with your skills and become the top player.\r\n<b>WHEEL OF FORTUNE / Roulette:</b> Rotate the wheel to win chips.\r\n<b>\u25cf START WITH more than 250,000 chips:\ud83c\udf81\ud83c\udf81\ud83c\udf81</b> \r\n<b>\u25cf OFFICIAL VEGAS EXPERIENCE:</b> Try your hand at Texas Hold'em, , Poker Tournament or Blackjack.\r\n<b>\u25cf VIP membership:</b> Enjoy VIP membership and especial perks.\r\n<b>\u25cf Facebook Connect:</b> Connect with Facebook and play with friends.\r\n\r\nNow you can select language of your choice. Available languages are:\r\n- German (Deutsch)\r\n- Portuguese (portugu\u00e9s)\r\n- French (franc\u00e9s)\r\n- Spanish (Espa\u00f1ol)\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\n\u25cf  This game is for adult audience (those 18 or older) for amusement purposes only. \r\n\u25cf  Game does not offer real money gambling or an opportunity to win real money. \r\n\u25cf  Practice or success at social casino gaming does not imply future success at real money gambling and gaming. \r\n\r\nPlease read our terms & privacy policy for more information.\r\n\r\nYou can connect with us on our Facebook page:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Poker-1046185402123163/\r\n\r\nFor any issue, suggestion or comment please mailto: support@zeemist.com",
